    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109403" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτρίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cry, squeak,</i> or <i>chirp,</i> of fowls, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				7.7
			</span></i>; of cats, ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτὸν ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					11.219
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.352
			</span></i> (cod. Plan., <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>crepitate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.3.4
			</span></i>:—freq. with v. l. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτρύζ-.</span></div>
